On 2026-11-01 the clocks in New York go back at 02:00 EDT. 03:30 happens once, after the change (EST, UTC-5), so it is 08:30 UTC. The list also holds the two naps of the repeated hour (05:30 and 06:30 UTC), and the match takes the nap that starts in the minute of 08:30 UTC.
-- args --
health
sleep
naps
delete
2026-11-01
03:30
-- stdin --
y
-- route GET /userprofile-service/userprofile/settings --
{"displayName":"tester","timeZone":"America/New_York"}
-- route GET /sleep-service/sleep/naps/2026-11-01 --
[{"napStartTimestampGMT":"2026-11-01T05:30:00","napTimeSec":600},{"napStartTimestampGMT":"2026-11-01T06:30:00","napTimeSec":600},{"napStartTimestampGMT":"2026-11-01T08:30:12","napTimeSec":900}]
-- route DELETE /sleep-service/sleep/nap/2026-11-01/1793521812000 204 --
